</div></blockquote></div></div></div><div data-index="1" class="slick-slide slick-active" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="false" style="outline:none;width:5.555555555555555%"><div><div class="p-2" tabindex="-1" style="width:100%;display:inline-block"><blockquote class="border border-[#E3E8EF] bg-white px-4 py-6"><header class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6 "><img src="https://media.facua.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/20133107/rafaelfernandez.jpg" alt="" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full  " loading="lazy"/><cite class="block text-sm font-bold whitespace-normal text-black-titles">Rafael Fernández</cite></header><div class="text-sm text-black-text"><p>«Con FACUA logré que condenaran a CaixaBank a devolverme más de 17.000 euros que me cobró ilegalmente con la cláusula suelo de mi hipoteca».</p>
