></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 w-full bg-[#FFF9EE]"><div class="  md:mb-none relative mb-4 h-full"><div class=""><a class="group block bg-cover bg-center hover:underline pb-[57%] md:pb-[57%]  " style="background-image:url(https://media.facua.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/09134253/recargoGLP.jpg)" href="/plataformas/Recargo GLP/"></a></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0"><div class="flex h-12 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-4 false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-6 py-1 text-black rounded-full cursor-pointer stroke-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.217 10.907a2.25 2.25 0 1 0 0 2.186m0-2.186c.18.324.283.696.283 1.093s-.103.77-.283 1.093m0-2.186 9.566-5.314m-9.566 7.5 9.566 5.314m0 0a2.25 2.25 0 1 0 3.935 2.186 2.25 2.25 0 0 0-3.935-2.186Zm0-12.814a2.25 2.25 0 1 0 3.933-2.185 2.25 2.25 0 0 0-3.933 2.185Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="p-4  "><div class="flex gap-2 my-2 "></div><a class="inline-block font-serif font-bold text-black-titles hover:text-black-titles hover:underline  text-lg" href="/plataformas/Recargo GLP/">¿Tienes gas canalizado GLP? Te han cobrado un recargo ilegal y puedes reclamar tu dinero</a></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 w-full bg-[#FFF9EE]"><div class="  md:mb-none relative mb-4 h-full"><div class=""><a class="group block bg-cover bg-center hover:underline pb-[57%] md:pb-[57%]  " style="background-image:url(https://media.facua.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/11143934/logo-Frenar-_v2.png)" href="/plataformas/paremos-a-la-extrema-derecha/"></a></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0"><div class="flex h-12 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-4 false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-6 py-1 text-black rounded-full cursor-pointer stroke-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.217 10.907a2.25 2.25 0 1 0 0 2.186m0-2.186c.18.324.283.696.283 1.093s-.103.77-.283 1.093m0-2.186 9.566-5.314m-9.566 7.5 9.566 5.314m0 0a2.25 2.25 0 1 0 3.935 2.186 2.25 2.25 0 0 0-3.935-2.186Zm0-12.814a2.25 2.25 0 1 0 3.933-2.185 2.25 2.25 0 0 0-3.933 2.185Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="p-4  "><div class="flex gap-2 my-2 "></div><a class="inline-block font-serif font-bold text-black-titles hover:text-black-titles hover:underline  text-lg" href="/plataformas/paremos-a-la-extrema-derecha/">Frenar a la extrema derecha</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-bg-light "><div class="px-6 pt-24 pb-12 mx-auto max-w-content"><div class="items-center justify-between mb-6 md:mb-4 md:flex"><h2 class="mb-4 font-sans text-3xl font-extrabold">Últimas acciones</h2><a href="https://arca.facua.org/subscripcion?option=pleno" class=" inline-block bg-primary border-solid  border-2  border-primary font-semibold  leading-none !text-white rounded-full hover:!bg-primary-dark hover:border-primary-dark hover:!text-white text-sm py-2 px-4">Quiero ser socio</a></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:grid md:grid-cols-4"><div class="h-full mb-6 border-b border-grey"><div class="  md:mb-none relative mb-4 h-full"><div class=""><a class="group block bg-cover bg-center hover:underline pb-[57%] md:pb-[57%]  " style="background-image:url(https://media.facua.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/01144636/plantilla-alerta-Tedi-26.png)" href="/noticias/facua-denuncia-a-ing-por-incumplir-su-promocion-de-descontar-el-10-sobre-las-compras-con-tarjeta-de-credito-a-sus-clientes/"></a></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0"><div class="flex h-12 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-4 false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden=