e="margin-left:-8px" href="/canal/telecos-y-privacidad/">Telecos y privacidad</a></div><a class="inline-block font-serif font-bold text-black-titles hover:text-black-titles hover:underline  text-lg" href="/noticias/facua-denuncia-ante-consumo-y-la-aepd-a-la-teleco-de-bertin-osborne-por-obstaculizar-cancelaciones-de-contratos/">FACUA denuncia ante Consumo y la AEPD a la teleco de Bertín Osborne por obstaculizar cancelaciones de contratos</a></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-end"><a class="flex gap-2 py-2 text-sm leading-6 text-contrast hover:text-primary-dark hover:opacity-80" href="/nuestrasacciones/"><span>Ver todas las acciones</span> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25 21 12m0 0-3.75 3.75M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-10 md:py-24"><h2 class="mb-4 font-nunito text-3xl font-extrabold">Newsletters</h2><div>Únete a FACUA y recibe nuestros boletines de noticias en tu correo electrónico.</div><div class="my-8 flex flex-col flex-wrap gap-4 md:grid md:grid-cols-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col justify-between border border-grey md:col-span-1"><header class="relative h-[185px] bg-cover bg-center"><img src="/assets/newsletter1.webp" alt="Newsletter 1" class="absolute w-full bottom-0 left-0 right-0 top-0 object-cover  h-[185px]" height="185" loading="lazy"/><a href="https://arca.facua.org/subscripcion?option=adherido" class="absolute right-4 top-4 max-w-full inline-block bg-primary border-solid  border-2  border-primary font-semibold  leading-none !text-white rounded-full hover:!bg-primary-dark hover:border-primary-dark hover:!text-white text-sm py-2 px-4">Quiero suscribirme</a><div class="absolute -bottom-3 left-0 inline-block flex h-6 flex-col items-center justify-center bg-black px-2 text-xs text-white">Exclusivo para socios</div></header><div class="p-4 pt-8"><h3 class="mb-2 font-sans text-lg font-bold">Consumidores en acción</h3><div class="mb-2">El boletín diario de FACUA, para informarte sobre los asuntos que te afectan como consumidor. En tu correo de lunes a viernes.</div></div><footer class="px-4 pt-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="rounded-bottom-left-none flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded rounded-md rounded-bl-none bg-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-3 w-3 stroke-[4px] font-bold text-white"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></div><span>De lunes a viernes</span><span>·</span><a class="text-primary hover:font-bold" href="/consumidores/">Ver ejemplo</a></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-t border-grey pt-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none text-gray-400"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0ZM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 14.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0 1 12 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632Z"></path></svg><span>¿Ya tienes cuenta?</span><a href="https://arca.facua.org/iniciarsesion" class="text-primary hover:font-bold">Iniciar sesión</a></div></footer></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col justify-between border border-grey md:col-span-1"><header class="relative h-[185px] bg-cover bg-center"><img src="/assets/newsletter2.webp" alt="Newsletter 1" class="absolute w-full bottom-0 left-0 right-0 top-0 object-cover  h-[185px]" height="185" loading="lazy"/><a href="https://arca.facua.org/subscripcion?option=adherido" class="absolute right-4 top-4 max-w-full inline-block bg-primary border-solid  border-2  border-primary font-semibold  leading-none !text-white rounded-full hover:!bg-primary-dark hover:border-primary-dark hover:!text-white text-sm py-2 px-4">Quiero suscribirme</a><div class="absolute -bottom-3 left-0 inline-block flex h-6 flex-col items-center justify-center bg-black px-2 text-xs text-white">Exclusivo para socios</div></header><div class="p-4 pt-8"><h3 class="mb-2 font-sans text-lg font-bold">FACUA informa</h3><div class="mb-2">Infórmate cada domingo sobre las denuncias, alertas, campañas, estudios y reivindicaciones de FACUA en defensa de los consumidores.</div></div><footer class="px-4 pt-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="rounded-bottom-left-none flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded rounded-md rounded-bl-none bg-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-3 w-3 stroke-[4px] font-bold text-white"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></div><span>Semanal</span><span>·</span><a class="text-primary hover:font-bold" href="/facuainforma/">Ver ejemplo</a></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-t border-grey pt-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none text-gray-400"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0ZM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 14.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0 1 12 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632Z"></path></svg><span>¿Ya tienes cuenta?</span><a href="https://arca.facua.org/iniciarsesion" class="text-primary hover:font-bold">Iniciar sesión</a></div></footer></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col justify-between border border-black-titles md:col-span-1"><header class="relative h-[185px] bg-cover bg-center"><img src="/assets/newsletter3.webp" alt="Newsletter 1" class="absolute w-full bottom-0 left-0 right-0 top-0 object-cover  h-[185px]" height="185" loading="lazy"/><a href="https://arca.facua.org/subscripcion?option=pleno" class="absolute right-4 top-4 max-w-full inline-block bg-primary border-solid  border-2  border-primary font-semibold  leading-none !text-white rounded-full hover:!bg-primary-dark hover:border-primary-dark hover:!text-white text-sm py-2 px-4">Quiero suscribirme</a><div class="absolute -bottom-3 left-0 inline-block flex h-6 flex-col items-center justify-center bg-black px-2 text-xs text-white">Exclusivo para socios de pleno derecho</div></header><div class="p-4 pt-8"><h3 class="mb-2 font-sans text-lg font-bold">Consumerismo</h3><div class="mb-2">Análisis y reportajes acerca de asuntos de actualidad, entrevistas y asesoramientos sobre tus derechos en una revista que FACUA edita desde 1984.</div></div><footer class="px-4 pt-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="rounded-bottom-left-none flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded rounded-md rounded-bl-none bg-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-3 w-3 stroke-[4px] font-bold text-white"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></div><span>Bimestral</span><span>·</span><a class="text-primary hover:font-bold" href="/consumerismo/">Ver ejemplo</a></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-t border-grey pt-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none text-gray-400"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0ZM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 14.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0 1 12 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632Z"></path></svg><span>¿Ya tienes cuenta?</span><a href="https://arca.facua.org/iniciarsesion" class="text-primary hover:font-bold">Iniciar sesión</a></div></footer></div></div></div><div class="bg-reclaim bg-cover bg-fixed bg-center text-white mix-blend-multiply"><div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-10 md:py-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-12 md:grid md:grid-cols-2"><div class="md:col-span-1 md:pr-6"><h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-sans font-bold text-white md:text-5xl">Reclama</h2><div class="mb-6 leading-6 text-white">Bancos, eléctricas, telefónicas, aseguradoras, aerolíneas, grandes establecimientos comerciales...<!-- --> <strong>Los consumidores sufrimos todo tipo de irregularidades. Si reclamamos solos, en muchas ocasiones las empresas nos ignoran y los gobiernos no actúan. Si lo hacemos unidos, tendremos más fuerza para defender nuestros derechos y frenar los abusos.</strong></div><a href="https://arca.facua.org/subscripcion?option=pleno" class="mt-4 inline-block bg-primary border-solid  border-2  border-primary font-semibold  leading-none !text-white rounded-full hover:!bg-primary-dark hover:border-primary-dark hover:!text-white text-sm py-2 px-4">Hacerme socio pleno</a></div><div class="md:col-span-1"><h3 class="mb-6 font-sans text-xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white">¿Por qué reclamar con FACUA?</h3><div class="mb-4"><div class="mb-3 border-b flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-lines pb-3"><div class="relative flex h-10 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-5 w-5 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 stroke-[4px] pt-1 font-bold text-[#10a24e]"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></div><div class="w-full"><div class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-between gap-4 pt-1"><div class="font-sans text-xl font-bold">Somos una gran organización</div><div class="pt-1 font-bold text-primary">+</div></div></div></div><div class="mb-3 border-b flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-lines pb-3"><div class="relative flex h-10 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-5 w-5 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 stroke-[4px] pt-1 font-bold text-[#10a24e]"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></div><div class="w-full"><div class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-between gap-4 pt-1"><div class="font-sans text-xl font-bold">Luchamos contra los abusos</div><div class="pt-1 font-bold text-primary">+</div></div></div></div><div class="mb-3 border-b flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-lines pb-3"><div class="relative flex h-10 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-5 w-5 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 stroke-[4px] pt-1 font-bold text-[#10a24e]"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></div><div class="w-full"><div class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-between gap-4 pt-1"><div class="font-sans text-xl font-bold">Independientes de empresas y gobiernos</div><div class="pt-1 font-bold text-primary">+</div></div></div></div><div class="mb-3 border-b flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-lines pb-3"><div class="relative flex h-10 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-5 w-5 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 stroke-[4px] pt-1 font-bold text-[#10a24e]"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></div><div class="w-full"><div class="flex w-full cursor-pointer justify-between gap-4 pt-1"><div class="font-sans text-xl font-bold">Resolvemos la mayoría de casos sin ir a tribunales</div><div class="pt-1 font-bold text-primary">+</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block bg-black px-4 md:hidden"></div></div></main></div><footer class="text-sans bg-bg-dark"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-4 px-6 py-12 mx-auto text-white max-w-content"><div class="flex flex-col items-center col-span-4 gap-4 mb-8 md:col-span-2 md:items-start lg:col-span-1"><a href="/" class="-m-1.5 p-1.5"><span class="sr-only">FACUA</span><img src="https://media.facua.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/09012724/logo-1.svg" alt="FACUA logo" class="h-12 w-auto brightness-[58%] contrast-[172%] grayscale-[79%] invert-[100%] saturate-[0%]  " loading="lazy"/></a><div class="text-lg font-bold font-content">Luchamos contra los abusos</div><a class="inline-block inline-block bg-primary border-solid  border-2  border-primary font-semibold  leading-none !text-white rounded-full hover:!bg-primary-dark hover:border-primary-dark hover:!text-white text-sm py-2 px-4" href="/unirme/">Unirme</a><a class="inline-block inline-block bg-transparent border-solid  border-2  border-white font-semibold  leading-none text-white rounded-full hover:!bg-primary-dark hover:border-primary-dark hover:!text-white text-sm py-2 px-4" href="/donaciones/">Hacer un donativo</a></div><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1"><div class="mb-2 font-bold text-center text-white md:text-left">Noticias</div><ul class="flex flex-col items-center mb-6 list-none md:items-start"><li class="mb-2"><a class="text-white" href="/noticias" aria-label="Últimas noticias">Últimas noticias</a></li><li class="mb-2"><a class="text-white" href="/nuestrasacciones" aria-label="Nuestras acciones">Nuestras acciones</a></li><li class="mb-2"><a class="text-white" href="/facuatv" aria-label="FACUA.tv">FACUA.tv</a></li><li class="mb-2"><a class="text-white" href="/consumerismo" aria-label="Consumerismo">Consumerismo</a></li><li class="mb-2"><a class="text-white" href="/newsletters" aria-label="Newsletters">Newsletters</a></li></ul><a class="flex justify-center gap-2 py-2 mb-6 text-white md:justify-start" href="/english/"><span>English version</span> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25 21 12m0 0-3.75 3.75M21 12H3"></path></svg></a><div class="social mb-8 flex items-center gap-2 justify-center md:justify-start"><a href="https://bsky.app/profile/facua.org" target="_blank"><svg class="flex-none w-7 h-7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="-15 -12 48.916664 46.916668"><path d="M12 10.8c-1.087-2.114-4.046-6.053-6.798-7.995C2.566.944 1.561 1.266.902 1.565C.139 1.908 0 3.08 0 3.768c0 .69.378 5.65.624 6.479c.815 2.736 3.713 3.66 6.383 3.364q.204-.03.415-.056q-.207.033-.415.056c-3.912.58-7.387 2.005-2.83 7.078c5.013 5.19 6.87-1.113 7.823-4.308c.953 3.195 2.05 9.271 7.733 4.308c4.267-4.308 1.172-6.498-2.74-7.078a9 9 0 0 1-.415-.056q.21.026.415.056c2.67.297 5.568-.628 6.383-3.364c.246-.828.624-5.79.624-6.478c0-.69-.139-1.861-.902-2.206c-.659-.298-1.664-.62-4.3 1.24C16.046 4.748 13.087 8.687 12 10.8" fill="white" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></a><a href="https://facebook.com/consumidoresenaccion" target="_blank"><svg class="flex-none w-6 h-6" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 52.916664 52.916668"><path d="m 21.994389,40.925854 h 6.00128 V 25.621211 h 4.20086 l 0.48041,-5.101551 h -4.68103 c 0,0 0,-1.94346 0,-2.915183 0,-1.214644 0.2402,-1.700495 1.44027,-1.700495 0.96026,0 3.24076,0 3.24076,0 